              "value": "-- TASK --\nGenerate a message to indicate no expenses could be found that matches the criteria.\n\n-- OUTPUT FORMAT --\nProduce a top-level JSON object matching this schema (no extra keys):\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Expense Assistant\",\n  \"intent\": \"{{$context.$nodes.EXPENSE_INQUIRY_ROUTER.$output.intention}}\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"1\",\n  \"title\": \"No Expenses Were Found\",\n  \"expenseQuery\": \"{{$context.$nodes.EXPENSE_INQUIRY_ROUTER.$output.expenseQuery}}\",\n  \"isReply\": \"{{$context.$nodes.EXPENSE_INQUIRY_ROUTER.$output.isReply}}\",\n  \"description\": \"No expenses were found matching the provided criteria\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"{{format $context.$system.$currentDateTime as dd-MM-yyyy HH:MM}}\",\n  \"topicName\": \"PolicyComplianceSummary\",\n  \"agent_response\": [\n    {\n      \"display_type\": \"text\",\n      \"display_sequence\": 1,\n      \"text\": \"<single paragraph a message indicates no expenses could be found that matches the criteria>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
